Patch summary:
Apply gfxstream's imported-AHardwareBuffer layout workaround to
synchronization2 barriers. Android passes no image layout with an
AHardwareBuffer, so importers transition it from VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_UNDEFINED;
upstream keeps the contents only on the legacy vkCmdPipelineBarrier path, and
through vkCmdPipelineBarrier2 the host driver may discard them, which left
Chromium/ANGLE Vulkan content black on Apple Silicon. The func_table.cpp hunk
is the generator's output for the functable.py change, applied to upstream's
checked-in file.

